    },
    "AUTO：每首歌记住自己的均衡器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AUTO: each song remembers its own equalizer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alist / OpenList 的地址形如 http://IP:5244/dav；群晖 WebDAV Server 默认端口 5005（HTTP）/ 5006（HTTPS）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alist / OpenList addresses look like http://IP:5244/dav. Synology WebDAV Server uses port 5005 (HTTP) / 5006 (HTTPS) by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alist / OpenList 网盘、NAS WebDAV": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alist / OpenList cloud drives, NAS WebDAV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amplayer - 点左上角菜单打开来源，或点播放列表的 ADD 添加音乐": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amplayer - open a source from the menu at the top left, or tap ADD in the playlist"
          }
