    "填 DSM 地址（例如 https://IP:5001、DDNS 域名），或直接填 QuickConnect ID，会自动选择局域网或外网线路。可浏览所有共享文件夹；装了 Audio Station 并建好索引时，还会显示专辑与播放列表。不支持开启了两步验证的账号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter the DSM address (for example https://IP:5001 or a DDNS domain) or a QuickConnect ID; the local or internet route is chosen automatically. You can browse all shared folders, and albums and playlists appear when Audio Station is installed and indexed. Accounts with two-step verification are not supported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填 Emby 服务器地址，部分安装需要带 /emby 后缀。": {
