    "本地没有带时间轴的歌词时，把歌名、歌手和时长发给 LRCLIB、网易云音乐、QQ 音乐和酷狗查找。找到的歌词保存在本机。“锁屏和车机显示歌词”打开时，锁屏、控制中心和 CarPlay 里歌手一行会换成当前这句。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When a song has no synced lyrics on the device, its title, artist and duration are sent to LRCLIB, NetEase Cloud Music, QQ Music and Kugou to look them up. Lyrics found are saved on this device. With \"Lyrics on Lock Screen and CarPlay\" on, the artist line on the Lock Screen, in Control Center and in CarPlay shows the current lyric line."
          }
        }
      }
    },
